boxTest: an object passed through an unchecked cast (Derived<D> as Base<C>) to an override that needs more of its argument (I1 and I2): the JVM's bridge and Kotlin/Native with genericSafeCasts throw a ClassCastException the test catches; ktc2 checks nothing at the call, and the interface call inside ends the program (kotlin.AbstractMethodError, not catchable). The family of PLAN 2.2 (unchecked casts), the owner's decision
